{title: Wo Meri Neend Mera Chain}
{artist: Sadhana Sargam Nadeem Shravan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E]lauta [Am]do
[Am]Woh mera pyaar mera dard mujhe
[E]lauta [Am]do
[Am]Neend jitni bhi [G]maine khoyi hai
[F]Chain jitna bhi [Am]maine khoya hai
[Am]Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E]lauta [Am]do.....
[Am]Ek masum [E]dil hai aur [Am]sitam hain kitne
[Am]Is mohabbat ke [E]siwa aur bhi [Am]gam hai kitne
[G]Is mohabbat ke siwa [Am]aur bhi gam hai kitne
[Am]Mere [E]ishq ka [F]imtehan yun [Am]na lo
[Am]Tumhein hai [E]kasam meri [F]jaan yun [Am]na lo
[Am]Khwaab jitne bhi [G]maine dekhe hain
[F]Yaad jitna kiya [Am]hai maine tujhe
[Am]Woh mere khwaab meri yaad mujhe
[E]lauta [Am]do
[Am]Yeh meri bhul [E]thi jo maine [Am]tuze pyar kiya
[Am]Na milne [E]waali mohabbat [Am]ka intezar kiya
[G]Na milne waali [Am]mohabbat ka intezar kiya
[Am]Yeh [E]kya rang [F]laayi hai [Am]meri wafa
[Am]Mili [E]hai mujhe [F]kis liye [Am]yeh saza
[Am]Teri chahat ki [G]pyaas thi mujhko
[F]Tujhko paane ki [G]thi ummeed mujhe
[Am]Woh meri neend mera chain mujhe
[E]Lauta [Am]DO......
